    Authorization: Bearer {admin-token}

put.description:
Sample request:

    PUT /api/sections/5
    Authorization: Bearer {admin-token}
    Content-Type: application/json

    {
        "title": "Teaching Experience",
        "weightPercent": 35,
        "displayOrder": 1
    }

Sample request:

    PUT /api/sections/reorder/1
    Authorization: Bearer {admin-token}
    Content-Type: application/json

    {
        "5": 1,
        "6": 2,
        "7": 3
    }

The dictionary key is the section ID, and the value is the new display order.

